<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-OVERNIGHT TOURISM UP 2.5 TIMES IN Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-OVERNIGHT TOURISM UP 2.5 TIMES IN Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight stays by foreign tourists in Estonia rose by 2.5 times in the fist quarter of 1997 compared to the first quarter of 1996, the statistics office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its monthly publication, the statistics office said that the number of tourists using accommodation services rose to 39,400 compared to 15,800 for first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The majority of foreign tourists spending the night in Estonia were Finnish citizens at 36,949.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
